  "fullDescription": "Bring the magic of Christmas into your home with this Santa Reindeer Sleigh Christmas 3D STL. This detailed festive sculpture features Santa Claus riding in an ornate sleigh pulled by a majestic reindeer, complete with decorative harness details, wrapped presents, Christmas trees, snowflake ornaments, and elegant scrollwork.\n\nThe model creates a beautiful Christmas centerpiece for shelves, mantels, tables, holiday displays, and seasonal decorating.\n\nFeatures\nDetailed Santa Claus character\nMajestic reindeer with large antlers\nOrnate Christmas sleigh\nDecorative scrollwork and winter motifs\nMultiple wrapped presents\nMini Christmas tree details\nSnowflake and holly decorations\nElegant festive centerpiece design\nPerfect for Christmas and winter displays\nGreat for tabletop, mantel, shelf, and holiday decor\nSuitable for FDM and resin 3D printing\nCan be scaled to suit your preferred print size\nIdeal for Christmas lovers and 3D printing enthusiasts\nPerfect For\n\nUse this model as a Christmas centerpiece, holiday tabletop decoration, mantel display, Christmas village accent, festive home decor, or handmade seasonal gift.\n\nPlease Note: This is a digital 3D model file. No physical product will be shipped. Please check your 3D printer and slicing software compatibility before printing. This 3D model is available only in STL color — if you’d like it colored, you’ll need to open the STL file in separate software to color it yourself.",
